; C15  Winning 42 pp. 46-48 (W42-p046-f, W42-p047-b, W42-p047-c, W42-p048-c);
; played in Hands 16, 28, 29 and 31 (pp. 31, 98, 101, 108)
; Rule, in our words: a setter on lead leads a tile that calls for count: a
; double whose suit still has count out first; otherwise a tile that calls for
; count, but not a low tile that calls for a five (it wins only if partner
; holds the top tile, and then partner cannot add count). A tile that calls for
; no count is led only when one more point sets the bid.
; Python gate (pour_setter gate_c15): tier A, the count-calling doubles; else
; tier B, count-calling tiles except a non-top tile calling for a five. The
; one-point exception is not in the gate.
; How this encoding differs: none in tiers A and B. The one-point exception is
; a third rule: with no tier A or B lead and one point to set, a lead that
; calls for no count. The book twice leads past tier A to a tile that calls the
; count that sets (Hand 28 T4, Hand 31 T5); the gate, and this file, lead the
; double (GAPS.md, aggregate).
; "Calls for count": a live count tile outside the hand follows the suit the
; tile leads. "Top": no live tile outside the hand outranks it in that suit.
(policy c15-setter-leads-call-for-count
  (fallback lowest-legal)
  (rule a-double-that-calls-for-count (select answer)
    (guard
      (query
        (roles (chair b) (chair me) (domino lead) (domino called) (context suit))
        (out lead)
        (pattern
          (viewer me)
          (declarer b)
          (opponent me b)
          (leader me)
          (next-actor me)
          (own-legal lead)
          (double lead)
          (leads-context lead suit)
          (live called)
          (not (own-legal called))
          (in called suit)
          (not (count called 0))))))
  (rule a-tile-that-calls-for-count (select answer)
    (guard
      (query
        (roles (chair b) (chair me) (domino lead) (domino called) (context suit))
        (out lead)
        (pattern
          (viewer me)
          (declarer b)
          (opponent me b)
          (leader me)
          (next-actor me)
          (own-legal lead)
          (not (double lead))
          (leads-context lead suit)
          (live called)
          (not (own-legal called))
          (in called suit)
          (not (count called 0))
          (none (roles (domino above)) (live above) (not (own-legal above)) (in above suit) (beats above lead suit)))
        (pattern
          (viewer me)
          (declarer b)
          (opponent me b)
          (leader me)
          (next-actor me)
          (own-legal lead)
          (not (double lead))
          (leads-context lead suit)
          (live called)
          (not (own-legal called))
          (in called suit)
          (not (count called 0))
          (none (roles (domino five)) (live five) (not (own-legal five)) (in five suit) (count five 5))))))
  (rule one-point-sets-lead-quietly (select answer)
    (guard
      (query
        (roles (chair b) (chair me) (domino lead) (context suit))
        (out lead)
        (pattern
          (viewer me)
          (declarer b)
          (opponent me b)
          (leader me)
          (next-actor me)
          (to-set 1)
          (own-legal lead)
          (leads-context lead suit)
          (none (roles (domino called)) (live called) (not (own-legal called)) (in called suit)
            (not (count called 0))))))))
